earth: the fishing towns set their own limits on the catch with the scientists, and after four lean years the count is rising
scene: Four years ago the fishing towns set their own limits on the catch, with the scientists counting. This spring, for the first time, the count is rising. At the harbour meeting someone says {rival}'s boat has been landing more than its share.
scene W: The limits only work if they bind every boat the same. {N} wants that said plainly at the meeting.
scene U: {N} has kept a log of every catch for four years. It matches the scientists' count almost exactly.
scene B: A rising stock means the limits will be raised. Whoever holds quota to spare will do well.
scene R: Four lean years of short trips and early nights. {N} wants one good long trip out past the point.
scene G: {N} learned the old grounds from {parent}. For the first time in years, there may be something to hand on.
